@Laneway_Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7287

@webhookToken = paste-a-minted-token
@messageId = <paste-a-provider-message-id@smtp-relay.mailin.fr>
@email = paste-the-delivery-address@example.com

### A hard bounce. 204, and every later message to the address drops with suppressedBy hardBounce.
POST {{Laneway_Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/webhooks/brevo
Authorization: Bearer {{webhookToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "hard_bounce",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "id": 1234567,
  "date": "2026-10-23 18:05:01",
  "ts": 1792775101,
  "message-id": "{{messageId}}",
  "ts_event": 1792775101,
  "subject": "Your Laneway password was changed",
  "tags": ["PasswordChanged"],
  "sending_ip": "185.41.28.109",
  "ts_epoch": 1792775101000,
  "reason": "550 5.1.1 Recipient address rejected"
}

### A spam complaint. 204, and every later message to the address drops with suppressedBy spam.
POST {{Laneway_Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/webhooks/brevo
Authorization: Bearer {{webhookToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "spam",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "id": 1234567,
  "date": "2026-10-23 18:06:01",
  "ts": 1792775161,
  "message-id": "{{messageId}}",
  "ts_event": 1792775161,
  "subject": "Your Laneway password was changed",
  "tags": ["PasswordChanged"],
  "X-Mailin-custom": "",
  "sending_ip": "185.41.28.109",
  "ts_epoch": 1792775161000
}

### A block. 204, and every later message to the address drops with suppressedBy blocked.
POST {{Laneway_Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/webhooks/brevo
Authorization: Bearer {{webhookToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "blocked",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "id": 1234567,
  "date": "2026-10-23 18:07:01",
  "ts": 1792775221,
  "message-id": "{{messageId}}",
  "ts_event": 1792775221,
  "subject": "Your Laneway password was changed",
  "tags": ["PasswordChanged"],
  "sending_ip": "185.41.28.109",
  "ts_epoch": 1792775221000,
  "reason": "blocked : due to blacklist user"
}

### An unsubscribe. 204. It stops only opt-out messages, so a password notice still goes out.
POST {{Laneway_Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/webhooks/brevo
Authorization: Bearer {{webhookToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "unsubscribed",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "id": 1234567,
  "date": "2026-10-23 18:08:01",
  "ts": 1792775281,
  "message-id": "{{messageId}}",
  "ts_event": 1792775281,
  "subject": "Your Laneway password was changed",
  "tags": ["PasswordChanged"],
  "sending_ip": "185.41.28.109",
  "user_agent": "Mozilla/5.0",
  "ts_epoch": 1792775281000
}

### No bearer. 401, and the API logs WebhookRejected with reason missing.
POST {{Laneway_Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/webhooks/brevo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "hard_bounce",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "message-id": "{{messageId}}"
}
